WEBVTT

00:25.750 --> 00:27.590
In a future to come...

00:27.660 --> 00:32.090
the third energy revolution arrives
with the invention of the Shizuma Drive...

00:32.230 --> 00:35.100
and mankind reaches a
newfound period of prosperity.

00:39.700 --> 00:42.540
But within the shadows
of this bright peace...

00:42.640 --> 00:45.440
two powers clash against each other.

00:47.710 --> 00:51.670
A secret organization bent on
world domination, the BF Group!

00:53.010 --> 00:55.640
Everything for Big Fire!

01:16.540 --> 01:19.030
And to oppose this threat,
the Experts of Justice...

01:19.140 --> 01:22.800
is formed from members
gathered from all across the globe!

01:22.940 --> 01:24.970
The International Police Organization!

01:25.080 --> 01:29.920
With them is the most powerful
robot on the planet, Giant Robo...

01:30.050 --> 01:32.320
and the young man who commands it.

01:32.450 --> 01:34.690
His name is Daisaku Kusama!

01:36.190 --> 01:38.290
Crush them! Giant Robo!

01:44.470 --> 01:52.470
<i>GIANT ROBO</i>

01:59.350 --> 02:04.910
<i>THE DAY THE EARTH STOOD STILL</i>

02:10.730 --> 02:12.190
This is the BF Group's Russia Base!

02:12.260 --> 02:14.136
Request permission to
discontinue the mission...

02:14.160 --> 02:16.280
due to the complete
failure of the Shizuma Drives!

02:16.360 --> 02:17.960
Message from the Mobile Base in Britain!

02:18.070 --> 02:20.516
We're beginning the evacuation
because the base was caught by the...

02:20.540 --> 02:22.440
effects of Vogler's
Anti-Shizuma field!

02:22.540 --> 02:24.700
This is New York!
Inform us of your situation!

02:24.840 --> 02:27.040
When will the operation be over?

02:27.340 --> 02:30.420
Please contact us regarding when the
Shizuma Drives will be operational again!

02:30.450 --> 02:31.940
This is the Arabian Tactical Team!

02:32.050 --> 02:35.170
Due to the failure of the Shizuma Drives,
this will be our final transmission.

02:35.220 --> 02:36.450
Please respond!

02:36.550 --> 02:38.020
This is the Alaska Base...

02:38.350 --> 02:42.220
Everyone with fire powers have already...

02:42.790 --> 02:44.620
We can't take...

02:44.790 --> 02:47.350
freezing temperatures...

02:47.800 --> 02:48.920
Please...

02:50.370 --> 02:52.160
Gentlemen! Can this be tolerated?

02:53.300 --> 02:56.930
True, the Still Earth Operation
is by no means ordinary.

02:57.110 --> 02:57.830
Agreed.

02:57.940 --> 03:04.370
A newcomer like you has no right to
be in command of Alberto to begin with!

03:05.880 --> 03:07.710
Yes, Jujoji has a valid point.

03:07.880 --> 03:10.320
Genya, isn't that your name, young one?

03:10.820 --> 03:15.550
We would like you to explain the Still
Earth Operation to our satisfaction.

03:15.820 --> 03:19.560
And tell us the whereabouts
of Alberto the Impact...

03:20.460 --> 03:21.550
What's the matter?

03:22.030 --> 03:23.190
Why do you remain silent?

03:23.630 --> 03:28.160
If you do not wish to be judged by the
Magnificent Ten, tell us everything!

03:37.510 --> 03:39.480
All right, you leave us no choice.

03:40.010 --> 03:41.010
Gentlemen!

03:49.360 --> 03:50.520
That is enough!

03:53.730 --> 03:56.960
The Magnificent Ten
should not act so rashly.

03:57.130 --> 04:00.400
Lest we lose morale
amongst our own people...

04:01.870 --> 04:05.900
Oh, if it isn't our master strategist,
Komei. He's graced us with his presence.

04:06.770 --> 04:09.900
Then I shall redirect the question to you.

04:10.680 --> 04:13.240
Are you saying you're all
unhappy with this operation?

04:13.750 --> 04:14.770
Yes.

04:15.080 --> 04:19.710
What need do we have for such
a large scale Bashtarle Effect?

04:19.920 --> 04:23.260
Can't you see that we ourselves are...

04:23.390 --> 04:28.990
We ourselves are being crippled by it...

04:29.200 --> 04:31.060
Is that all you had to say?

04:32.770 --> 04:36.930
You'll just have to believe me.
It's all going according to plan.

04:37.210 --> 04:39.610
No! There are more questions
we would like to have answered!

04:39.770 --> 04:44.440
Why was Alberto the Impact, a
member of the Magnificent Ten...

04:44.550 --> 04:47.850
placed under the command
of Genya, a relative newcomer?

04:48.020 --> 04:51.250
Also, explain his disappearance!

04:51.990 --> 04:55.180
Yes, this man has many secrets.

04:55.320 --> 05:00.190
This sea of deception will be
forgiven if it can be explained.

05:00.460 --> 05:01.460
Agreed!

05:02.000 --> 05:05.360
We've heard that Alberto's archrival,
Taiso, fell in Shanghai.

05:05.730 --> 05:08.900
If this is true, who could have
possibly defeated Alberto?

05:09.540 --> 05:13.370
The only ones who can
oppose the Magnificent Ten are...

05:13.470 --> 05:16.310
the IPO's Celestial Nine!

05:16.440 --> 05:19.680
However, they should've been
unable to act under the effects...

05:19.780 --> 05:21.880
of the Shizuma Nullification Field!

05:24.020 --> 05:26.420
And allow me to show you further evidence!

05:34.800 --> 05:38.200
This is Alberto's daughter,
Sunny the Magician.

05:38.400 --> 05:41.770
She has a powerful
telepathic link with her father.

05:41.940 --> 05:43.170
Isn't that right?

05:43.300 --> 05:44.300
Yes.

05:45.040 --> 05:50.600
If something should happen
to my father, I would know of it.

05:50.880 --> 05:53.110
But I don't sense anything yet...

05:55.650 --> 05:59.140
We know that Alberto cannot be dead.

05:59.290 --> 06:02.020
Then where is Alberto of Impact?

06:02.190 --> 06:03.750
Give us an answer!

06:03.890 --> 06:05.550
Now! Now! Now!

06:06.360 --> 06:08.230
Now! Genya!

06:08.460 --> 06:09.830
What is your answer?

06:09.930 --> 06:11.020
W-Well, that's...

06:11.430 --> 06:12.430
Fine then!

06:13.800 --> 06:16.640
I shall answer that question.

06:16.940 --> 06:20.140
First, the whereabouts
of Alberto the Impact!

06:20.410 --> 06:23.570
We believe that he
has fled the battlefield!

06:23.680 --> 06:28.080
There is a possibility that he
might have betrayed us and turned!

06:28.350 --> 06:29.210
No!

06:29.350 --> 06:30.510
Father wouldn't...

06:32.450 --> 06:35.690
As for the second question
regarding this operation...

06:35.820 --> 06:38.690
Genya is the one who provided
us with the plans and the samples.

06:38.790 --> 06:40.560
It's plain and simple.

06:41.000 --> 06:43.970
He is more suited to
run this operation than...

06:44.100 --> 06:46.230
any member of the Magnificent Ten!

06:46.330 --> 06:49.100
This is also the will
of our leader, Big Fire!

06:58.950 --> 07:02.580
However, the points made by
the Magnificent Ten have merit.

07:02.680 --> 07:06.680
Shall we adjust the timetable a bit?

07:06.790 --> 07:08.090
What say you, Genya?

07:08.660 --> 07:09.660
Yes.

07:10.860 --> 07:12.990
This way, the BF Group associates...

07:13.130 --> 07:15.890
scattered across the
globe can be accommodated.

07:16.000 --> 07:19.230
Will this be acceptable,
gentlemen of the Magnificent Ten?

07:42.990 --> 07:45.120
What is going on here?

07:45.390 --> 07:48.120
Even our leader Big Fire wouldn't...

07:48.300 --> 07:51.130
Could it be that Komei
is acting on his own?

07:57.340 --> 07:58.570
What's the matter, Sunny?

07:58.840 --> 08:01.240
H-Hanzui...

08:01.580 --> 08:03.140
be careful...

08:06.580 --> 08:10.540
The secret lies in Genya's past...

08:15.090 --> 08:16.090
Sunny!

08:21.630 --> 08:23.620
That voice was...

08:46.820 --> 08:47.910
Professor Go!

08:48.120 --> 08:51.090
Where are... we're back in headquarters?

08:53.830 --> 08:56.260
Issei, you're safe.

08:56.530 --> 08:57.590
Then...

08:58.170 --> 09:00.690
The loss of Youshi was unfortunate.

09:13.550 --> 09:15.210
R-Robo?

09:24.060 --> 09:25.420
Daisaku...

09:25.590 --> 09:28.720
I'm sorry, but we have to
seal Robo away for now...

09:29.060 --> 09:30.090
Robo...

09:30.300 --> 09:33.060
Don't worry, it will only be temporary.

09:33.170 --> 09:36.230
As proof of our intent, you can see
that we've repaired his right hand.

09:36.370 --> 09:40.140
The only thing that concerns us is
that formation on his right shoulder.

09:40.410 --> 09:43.440
We can't seem to melt it
or perform any scans at all.

09:43.610 --> 09:47.240
When we saw it in the Himalayas,
we thought it was just snow, but...

09:47.380 --> 09:48.970
Then the BF Group...

09:49.150 --> 09:53.090
We're not sure, but the possibility of
it being a spell of some sort is unlikely.

09:54.720 --> 09:56.690
What is that?

09:57.220 --> 09:58.450
What's going on here?

09:58.590 --> 10:01.620
Why do Ginrei and Robo
have to be treated like this?

10:03.700 --> 10:05.130
Why...

10:05.970 --> 10:08.870
This is all for the
benefit of you and Ginrei.

10:21.720 --> 10:23.340
Mr. Murasame?

10:23.880 --> 10:25.350
But you were...

10:26.920 --> 10:29.190
You saw me die, right?

10:29.320 --> 10:30.810
Well, let's just let that go for now.

10:30.930 --> 10:32.290
B-But...

10:32.430 --> 10:33.620
Daisaku...

10:34.400 --> 10:36.660
We heard everything from Murasame.

10:36.800 --> 10:40.100
To think that Emanuel is still alive...

10:40.330 --> 10:41.390
Professor Go?

10:41.500 --> 10:42.770
I'm sorry.

10:42.970 --> 10:46.170
I too have hidden my past.

10:47.270 --> 10:51.710
Yes, ten years ago, I was
Professor Vogler's top assistant.

10:52.850 --> 10:53.910
Professor...

10:54.080 --> 10:58.880
And I'm also one of the witnesses
to the Tragedy of Bashtarle...

11:05.160 --> 11:08.860
Ginrei and I survived thanks
to her teleportation ability.

11:09.260 --> 11:13.100
And believing that the
Professor was innocent...

11:13.270 --> 11:17.500
we joined the International
Police Organization to go into hiding.

11:17.940 --> 11:19.340
Why do you think we did that?

11:21.980 --> 11:25.810
It wasn't because we feared
persecution for being the...

11:25.910 --> 11:29.080
Professor's daughter and his assistant.

11:29.180 --> 11:32.380
When we saw the completion
of the Shizuma Drive and the...

11:32.490 --> 11:34.180
prosperity it brought to the world...

11:34.890 --> 11:39.590
we realized that this was the
vision that the professor held.

11:39.830 --> 11:43.960
We felt that the truth never
needed to be revealed.

11:44.670 --> 11:45.530
Ginrei...

11:45.630 --> 11:48.540
no, Farmelle Von Vogler
and I both agreed to...

11:48.670 --> 11:51.800
keep the truth to
ourselves for the greater good.

11:53.210 --> 11:56.080
But then the professor's will
changed into a desire for revenge.

11:56.380 --> 12:00.250
I hoped that it was some kind of mistake.

12:00.410 --> 12:03.750
But the fact that Emanuel
has the samples adds to the...

12:03.850 --> 12:07.620
validity of Professor Vogler's
last words... "Stop Shizuma!"

12:08.260 --> 12:09.720
Without a doubt...

12:12.230 --> 12:16.250
Yes, the proof is in the nature
of the Anti-Shizuma Field...

12:16.460 --> 12:18.876
starting in Shanghai. It not
only nullified the Shizuma Drives...

12:18.900 --> 12:23.000
but it also eliminated
all of the oxygen from the...

12:23.140 --> 12:26.800
area when it reacted
with our data simulations.

12:28.310 --> 12:31.110
If all three samples should
be brought together...

12:31.480 --> 12:32.480
Yes...

12:36.820 --> 12:40.480
Most likely all oxygen
on the planet will...

12:40.720 --> 12:43.660
Then why are you sealing Robo away?

12:43.860 --> 12:47.730
Robo is the best hope we
have to stop the Giant Sphere!

12:47.860 --> 12:49.390
But Robo has already...

12:49.500 --> 12:52.490
No! That time I was an idiot!

12:53.000 --> 12:54.370
But this time for sure!

12:54.470 --> 12:55.560
No...

12:55.840 --> 12:57.570
It won't be necessary.

12:57.910 --> 12:59.200
Why do you say that?

13:00.140 --> 13:03.940
I figured out its weakness in France...

13:04.550 --> 13:10.970
Yes, the only one who can
defeat it on this Earth is Ginrei!

13:13.290 --> 13:14.850
I don't understand.

13:14.920 --> 13:17.550
Then why do you have Ginrei in there?

13:18.690 --> 13:19.960
Don't you understand?

13:21.560 --> 13:25.520
Because Ginrei is Vogler's daughter!

13:54.360 --> 13:55.920
The beautiful night...

13:58.170 --> 14:04.000
When I watch that reactor being built...

14:04.240 --> 14:07.300
I wonder what kind
of future awaits you all...

14:08.080 --> 14:14.210
What kind of world will we
scientists be able to leave for you?

14:14.650 --> 14:17.310
Those thoughts come to me at these times...

14:18.350 --> 14:19.350
Father...

14:24.490 --> 14:31.330
Mankind illuminated the dark of night
with fire and was freed from its terror.

14:31.670 --> 14:36.540
However, at the same time, much
sacrifice needed to be endured.

14:36.640 --> 14:40.130
Pollution. The destruction of Nature.
The depletion of the Ozone Layer.

14:40.440 --> 14:45.810
Only when disaster strikes,
do we fear, panic and regret.

14:46.350 --> 14:49.150
But we are at our limits.

14:49.380 --> 14:55.150
If something worse should
happen, there will be no going back.

14:56.220 --> 14:59.250
What are we?

14:59.890 --> 15:03.260
Are we nothing but destroyers
hiding behind the veil of progress?

15:05.070 --> 15:06.090
Father!

15:07.130 --> 15:12.070
My dearest wish is that if
science requires such sacrifices...

15:12.210 --> 15:16.440
we should use science to
stop them from happening again!

15:16.910 --> 15:19.850
Figuring out how to do that may be the...

15:19.950 --> 15:22.440
only way to leave a
future for you to live in.

15:23.480 --> 15:26.750
I'm sure that's what your
mother would have wanted.

15:27.760 --> 15:34.090
Soon, I will be able to
find the answers I seek.

15:35.260 --> 15:38.560
Can you see it?

15:39.600 --> 15:41.930
I can see it clearly.

15:42.040 --> 15:43.900
It's your world.

15:44.270 --> 15:48.370
A bright future where
you need not fear the night!

15:49.110 --> 15:51.670
It's not an illusion!

16:04.090 --> 16:05.090
That's right...

16:05.760 --> 16:09.790
No one thought about the
welfare of the Earth like my father...

16:10.200 --> 16:15.000
But mankind soiled my father's
name without knowing the truth.

16:17.240 --> 16:18.640
Stop it!

16:19.370 --> 16:21.470
Stop Shizuma!

16:22.910 --> 16:25.180
I have come too far to wait any longer!

16:26.710 --> 16:29.910
<i>The Net of Justice</i>

16:30.080 --> 16:34.680
<i>Evil must be brought to justice.</i>

16:40.030 --> 16:42.120
The beautiful night...

16:42.760 --> 16:46.700
But mankind quickly forgets
anything it feels is dirty.

16:47.970 --> 16:50.330
They don't realize who it is
that they need to be thanking!

16:51.510 --> 16:54.370
I will make them remember...

16:54.540 --> 16:56.200
what the true night is like!

16:56.440 --> 16:58.380
We've failed!

16:59.680 --> 17:02.710
How dare he mock the BF Group?

17:03.680 --> 17:04.980
What's the matter, Uncle?

17:05.920 --> 17:08.620
He made a fool out of all of us!

17:10.120 --> 17:11.120
What is this?

17:11.530 --> 17:12.620
It can't be!

17:30.540 --> 17:31.840
Genya...

17:32.050 --> 17:33.810
Why you...

17:36.150 --> 17:37.350
Uncle...

17:37.580 --> 17:38.750
Listen, Sunny...

17:38.850 --> 17:39.410
Yes?

17:39.720 --> 17:42.250
You stay right here, understood?

17:42.490 --> 17:43.490
Yes.

18:01.780 --> 18:06.340
First Class Emergency! All
personnel remain at your stations!

18:06.450 --> 18:11.250
First Class Emergency! Not even the
Magnificent Ten are permitted to move!

18:11.520 --> 18:15.390
This entire base is now under
the command of Komei Shokatsu.

18:15.490 --> 18:17.150
Like hell, Komei!

18:17.720 --> 18:19.750
We must not let him go.

18:20.490 --> 18:23.430
Even if this is Komei's operation...

18:23.560 --> 18:26.470
Jujoji, we're going to
Priority One Battle Stations!

18:27.000 --> 18:31.200
The path is mine! The
one who seeks is Jujoji!

19:02.640 --> 19:03.640
Fools!

19:28.560 --> 19:32.970
Without your Shizuma Drives,
you're all useless piles of metal!

19:33.230 --> 19:34.230
Curses!

19:34.740 --> 19:36.500
It seems like we'll
have to do it ourselves!

19:37.270 --> 19:39.400
We'll split into three groups!

19:39.670 --> 19:40.670
Agreed!

19:45.410 --> 19:47.240
I see, he's Vogler's son, huh?

19:48.080 --> 19:50.020
If so, Genya's plan is obvious.

19:50.480 --> 19:54.980
Leave it to Alberto the Impact to
use the last of his strength to inform us.

19:55.290 --> 19:57.760
Yes, but he must still be alive.

19:58.030 --> 20:00.190
We have no more doubts!

20:03.030 --> 20:07.490
Then, Genya even fooled Komei?

20:07.700 --> 20:09.230
Yes, what a laugh...

20:09.840 --> 20:13.330
One man has managed to fool the...

20:13.440 --> 20:17.340
entire BF Group into
becoming his tool for revenge.

20:21.650 --> 20:22.650
What's wrong?

20:24.120 --> 20:27.280
Did Komei really not see this coming?

20:29.590 --> 20:33.250
Come to think of it, it is a
rather basic mistake for Komei.

20:33.890 --> 20:38.160
If this is part of Komei's plan...

20:38.330 --> 20:40.820
what benefit does it
have for the BF Group...

20:40.930 --> 20:43.430
or for Big Fire?

20:44.070 --> 20:45.070
All right!

20:45.170 --> 20:48.440
Why don't you go ask Komei yourself?

20:48.810 --> 20:49.940
Leave Genya to me!

20:50.080 --> 20:51.080
Thank you!

21:00.550 --> 21:02.180
You watch Genya!

21:02.660 --> 21:06.390
If the Magnificent Ten get together,
we can take on a Giant Sphere or two...

21:32.090 --> 21:33.090
Damn it!

21:50.100 --> 21:53.440
That creature and its hypnotic
light could never work on us.

21:53.940 --> 21:57.540
Still, you're quick use
terrifying insects yourself!

21:57.810 --> 22:01.610
I'm flattered, but I'll leave the
rest to you, turbulent old man!

22:01.820 --> 22:02.820
Right!

22:03.020 --> 22:04.580
Then let us fly!

22:13.490 --> 22:15.050
I do not think so!

22:15.430 --> 22:16.660
Sorry...

22:17.160 --> 22:18.560
but you'll have to get off here.

22:18.830 --> 22:19.830
What?

22:19.970 --> 22:21.060
Komei!

22:39.550 --> 22:41.920
We ten are the true heroes!

22:42.020 --> 22:44.510
Playing with such toys is laughable!

22:51.330 --> 22:56.360
If you insist on opposing us,
you shall return to the previous life!

22:56.570 --> 23:00.440
Listen! All that prospers must
decline! So rings the Bell of Life!

23:10.980 --> 23:12.110
More?

23:23.830 --> 23:25.360
No, no, no, no!

23:28.400 --> 23:29.700
No!

23:46.450 --> 23:49.290
Now, where are you, Komei?

23:50.620 --> 23:52.680
Look no further!

23:52.830 --> 23:53.830
What?

24:00.400 --> 24:01.830
Jujoji?

24:08.740 --> 24:11.640
For his power to be so great...

24:11.980 --> 24:13.470
Hanzui?

24:13.750 --> 24:15.080
You two...

24:20.450 --> 24:21.450
Garuda?

24:22.320 --> 24:23.810
It can't be...

24:39.570 --> 24:40.570
Neputune!

24:43.740 --> 24:45.410
Zangetsu...

24:46.010 --> 24:47.670
And that's...

24:48.650 --> 24:51.680
Garuda and Neptune.

24:53.320 --> 24:54.650
That is correct!

24:54.820 --> 24:57.420
Our boss's personal guards!

24:57.960 --> 24:59.620
Komei, why you...

24:59.860 --> 25:01.230
Silence!

25:02.360 --> 25:03.630
Bow your heads!

25:03.730 --> 25:07.190
You are in the presence
of our leader, Big Fire!

25:16.280 --> 25:18.970
Now there should be no more questions!

25:19.210 --> 25:21.270
Do not interfere with Genya any further!

25:22.120 --> 25:26.350
I repeat, everything
is the will of Big Fire!

25:31.990 --> 25:33.760
This can't be...

25:34.090 --> 25:38.090
It's too early for our
master Big Fire to appear!

25:38.300 --> 25:39.860
I don't get it...

25:40.400 --> 25:44.770
This situation is getting even
more confusing, Alberto...

25:52.650 --> 25:57.950
Now all that's left is
to watch things unfold.

26:33.620 --> 26:37.460
Then why does Ginrei have to be...

26:40.260 --> 26:44.390
I heard you tried to
argue with the Chief also...

26:45.130 --> 26:48.830
But this time, Taiso isn't
around to comfort you.

26:50.370 --> 26:53.030
Now, now, don't look so angry.

26:53.970 --> 26:54.970
Listen...

26:55.380 --> 26:57.170
You saw it too, didn't you?

26:57.310 --> 27:03.310
It was a momentary impulse, but Ginrei
nearly gave her brother the attache case.

27:03.520 --> 27:08.320
What would have happened
if you didn't make Robo act...

27:08.520 --> 27:11.150
or if Issei and I
didn't get there in time?

27:11.520 --> 27:12.990
W-Well, that's...

27:13.330 --> 27:17.130
Right. The case would have gone
back into the hands of the BF Group...

27:17.260 --> 27:19.760
and the whole planet
would be standing still by now.

27:19.900 --> 27:21.230
But that's not all.

27:21.470 --> 27:23.800
If Professor Go's data is correct...

27:23.940 --> 27:27.430
then the whole planet would be
without air, and it would really be over.

27:28.040 --> 27:31.380
Ginrei was just in
shock after hearing that...

27:31.510 --> 27:33.810
her father had survived
the tragedy, and so...

27:33.950 --> 27:37.440
I'm sure Ginrei wouldn't
have given the sample over!

27:40.990 --> 27:42.180
No.

27:43.920 --> 27:45.690
She would have...

27:49.700 --> 27:52.360
Then let me ask you this...

27:52.800 --> 27:53.800
Huh?

27:54.070 --> 27:56.000
What are you doing with Giant Robo...

27:56.100 --> 27:58.830
the machine passed
down to you by your father?

27:59.040 --> 28:01.980
That's obvious! Protecting
the world from the BF Group!

28:02.180 --> 28:04.410
That's what my father told me...

28:05.650 --> 28:06.650
That's right.

28:06.710 --> 28:11.810
Your father's last will and
testament is absolute, right?

28:11.950 --> 28:14.080
Then what about Ginrei?

28:14.420 --> 28:16.550
Stop it!

28:16.760 --> 28:18.730
S-Stop Shizuma!

28:18.990 --> 28:22.520
If Ginrei had decided to go
along with her brother, Genya...

28:22.630 --> 28:25.860
to fulfill their father's
wishes with the three samples...

28:25.970 --> 28:28.300
it shouldn't come
to you as a surprise...

28:28.670 --> 28:29.670
B-But...

28:30.270 --> 28:34.170
Then hypothetically, if your father,
Professor Kusama, had made Robo...

28:34.310 --> 28:38.140
for the purpose of World Domination
and then passed it along to you...

28:38.380 --> 28:41.910
what would you have done?

28:42.080 --> 28:46.180
My father would never
do anything like that!

28:46.820 --> 28:48.020
You're such a child.

28:48.120 --> 28:49.350
Think about it.

28:49.420 --> 28:52.880
You can say that only because we saved you.

28:53.490 --> 28:56.690
Come to think of it, the
professor once said...

28:56.900 --> 29:00.960
"Can happiness be
attained without sacrifice?"

29:01.430 --> 29:02.800
He was absolutely right!

29:03.040 --> 29:04.776
The answer is simple!
What were the sacrifices?

29:04.800 --> 29:07.330
Look at Taiso and Youshi!

29:07.540 --> 29:10.980
If they weren't sacrifices,
then what were they?

29:15.520 --> 29:18.580
All you have to do is think of
Ginrei as a sacrifice as well!

29:18.720 --> 29:21.620
And it would be a reasonable
sacrifice for saving the world!

29:25.760 --> 29:31.490
If things could be settled that
easily, I would gladly sacrifice myself!

29:31.830 --> 29:35.320
Didn't I say so when I rescued you?

29:35.470 --> 29:38.340
But, you can talk like
that because you're alive!

30:00.960 --> 30:03.830
M-Mister Murasame?

30:04.560 --> 30:06.160
Mister Murasame!

30:07.470 --> 30:08.470
Mister Murasame!

30:09.170 --> 30:10.540
Mister Mura...

30:20.580 --> 30:25.110
For future happiness, I would sacrifice
myself as many times as needed!

30:27.350 --> 30:30.690
This is my ability as an Expert of Justice.

30:31.290 --> 30:34.690
From an injury like this one, I
can come back to life right away.

30:37.030 --> 30:40.230
That's right, I'm a man who can't die.

30:41.370 --> 30:43.700
B-But, then...

31:14.270 --> 31:15.270
Murasame!

31:15.570 --> 31:16.930
So this is where you were...

31:18.200 --> 31:19.830
Professor Go, what's going on?

31:20.210 --> 31:21.800
It's really bad.

31:22.140 --> 31:25.840
An unbelievably powerful anti-field
is spreading across the land.

31:26.310 --> 31:27.410
Is it him?

31:51.270 --> 31:54.040
I'll finish everything with
just two of the samples!

32:01.080 --> 32:02.170
You mean, he's...

32:02.820 --> 32:06.680
As predicted, the Giant Sphere
has appeared at St. Abbe.

32:06.820 --> 32:09.290
But it's earlier than our calculations!

32:09.620 --> 32:12.180
Professor Go, by St. Abbe, you mean...

32:12.490 --> 32:13.490
Yes!

32:13.530 --> 32:18.400
The last Shizuma Power Plant left on
Earth. It was completed a week ago!

32:18.830 --> 32:23.390
And it's built on the place
that was once called Bashtarle!

32:23.700 --> 32:24.700
What?

32:32.850 --> 32:35.680
Yes, everything started at this place.

32:36.080 --> 32:40.680
Changing its name and trying
to cleanse the past is useless!

32:41.850 --> 32:43.020
Because...

32:43.920 --> 32:47.990
The power plant mankind has made
as their symbol of peace lies on...

32:48.130 --> 32:52.260
top of the ruins where my father,
Franken Von Vogler, sleeps eternally!

32:52.400 --> 32:55.700
Along with his lost hopes
and ruined reputation!

32:59.640 --> 33:01.400
Take a look, Father!

33:01.640 --> 33:05.410
Everything started here
and everything shall end here!

33:15.590 --> 33:16.590
A man?

33:28.670 --> 33:29.670
This is bad.

33:29.740 --> 33:33.800
Have I come to the wrong conclusion again?

33:33.970 --> 33:39.210
No, if there's any chance we have, it's
because Chief Chujo went ahead of us.

33:39.350 --> 33:42.040
But that sacrifice would be too great!

33:42.450 --> 33:44.110
You don't think the chief will...

33:44.650 --> 33:48.380
Yes! I'm certain the chief will use it...

33:51.620 --> 33:55.060
He will use the power that no one can stop.

33:55.190 --> 33:57.790
His amazing power that
has an equaling fitting name...

34:03.340 --> 34:04.770
What is he going to do?

34:20.850 --> 34:21.850
What a laugh!

34:21.890 --> 34:24.920
You don't really plan to take on the
Giant Sphere with your bare hands?

34:28.530 --> 34:29.530
That's correct!

34:30.200 --> 34:34.000
I, Chujo the Silent, can handle
the likes of you by myself!

34:37.840 --> 34:38.840
What?

34:52.120 --> 34:54.310
This is all my fault.

34:54.720 --> 34:57.160
I have calculated everything incorrectly!

34:57.490 --> 35:01.360
Because I wanted to
believe in Professor Vogler...

35:01.560 --> 35:04.460
now even Chief Chujo might be...

35:05.430 --> 35:10.030
I should have destroyed the
sample before it got to this point!

35:10.470 --> 35:13.440
No, this isn't your fault!

35:13.710 --> 35:16.970
There is no way you could
have predicted all of this!

35:17.340 --> 35:21.750
But we never expected him
to give up on the third sample.

35:22.250 --> 35:23.580
Mister Murasame...

35:29.320 --> 35:30.090
That's...

35:30.220 --> 35:32.190
That's Big Gold!

35:34.090 --> 35:35.360
Correct!

35:36.830 --> 35:38.700
You are well informed!

35:41.070 --> 35:43.400
You're the Red Mask of the Magnificent Ten!

35:44.100 --> 35:44.930
Indeed.

35:45.040 --> 35:48.100
Now, return the third sample to me!

35:48.240 --> 35:49.070
Damn it!

35:49.180 --> 35:54.410
They knew that the Celestial Nine
weren't here and chose this time to attack!

35:57.550 --> 35:59.450
I am not alone!

35:59.820 --> 36:00.820
Observe!

36:23.440 --> 36:25.270
How dare you!

36:29.220 --> 36:30.510
Why you!

36:30.720 --> 36:31.810
Name yourself!

36:37.090 --> 36:38.150
Fine then...

36:42.530 --> 36:45.290
My name is The Fabulous Fitzcarrald!

36:45.730 --> 36:47.130
The Magnificent Ten!

36:47.630 --> 36:48.790
Two of them at the same time!

36:48.970 --> 36:51.960
Oh no, you are even more fortunate!

36:53.110 --> 36:56.340
Today is special because we have one more!

37:04.880 --> 37:08.410
All hands able to fight,
prepare to defend the base!

37:08.790 --> 37:12.560
Don't allow the enemy to take
control of our main headquarters!

37:12.690 --> 37:14.680
All right! Go forth and fight!

37:30.440 --> 37:33.240
By the bright light of the moon and sun!

37:33.450 --> 37:35.540
We serve under the name
of the noble bloodline!

37:35.850 --> 37:37.680
We are the Blood Wind Clan!

37:37.780 --> 37:41.120
Master Doki of the
Lineage! Allow us the honor!

37:52.160 --> 37:53.960
Why you!

38:14.720 --> 38:18.660
Without the Celestial Nine,
Ryozanpaku is no match for us!

38:20.460 --> 38:24.190
Boy, I will crush you along
with the controller for Robo!

38:33.610 --> 38:36.010
Daisaku, run for it!

38:36.780 --> 38:38.040
Take care of Ginrei!

38:38.940 --> 38:39.940
Hurry!

38:48.820 --> 38:49.880
Professor Go!

38:50.290 --> 38:51.760
Murasame!

39:05.710 --> 39:07.570
This time, you will die!

39:12.080 --> 39:13.100
What?

39:25.520 --> 39:26.520
Damn it!

39:26.660 --> 39:29.750
I didn't expect an open cavern here...

39:35.300 --> 39:36.700
Robo! Go!

39:48.180 --> 39:49.980
Curse you, Giant Robo!

40:05.600 --> 40:07.460
Robo! Toss him out!

40:08.000 --> 40:09.870
I don't think so!

40:38.360 --> 40:39.990
G-Ginrei!

40:47.740 --> 40:48.800
Ginrei!

40:48.970 --> 40:50.310
Ginrei!

40:56.080 --> 40:57.980
Want some help?

41:02.460 --> 41:04.120
In that case, you'll be torn to pieces!

41:12.970 --> 41:13.970
Mr. Murasame!

41:14.130 --> 41:16.600
Didn't I tell you? I'm immortal!

41:17.070 --> 41:18.130
Now go!

41:18.300 --> 41:19.700
I'll hold him off!

41:25.440 --> 41:27.850
Listen when an adult tells you to go!

41:28.880 --> 41:30.010
No, I won't!

41:32.080 --> 41:37.650
If I do, everyone who
died will have died in vain!

41:38.660 --> 41:40.630
Taiso! Youshi!

41:40.960 --> 41:44.330
All the adults around me were great people!

41:44.630 --> 41:47.570
But I don't like you at all!

41:49.130 --> 41:50.130
Because...

41:50.840 --> 41:56.780
I can't accept someone who
has no regard for being alive!

41:57.680 --> 41:59.540
What sacrifice?

41:59.950 --> 42:03.940
None of this is necessary!

42:04.520 --> 42:11.980
If, like you said, sacrificing
Ginrei is the adult thing to do...

42:13.730 --> 42:17.060
I don't want to be an adult at all!

42:18.100 --> 42:20.120
I'd rather stay a child...

42:20.500 --> 42:24.230
I'm going to go on believing in my father!

42:24.940 --> 42:27.300
And I'm sure Ginrei feels the same!

42:27.740 --> 42:28.740
That's why...

42:29.310 --> 42:30.310
That's why...

42:31.080 --> 42:32.240
That's why...

42:45.760 --> 42:49.130
Sorry boy, you don't have
anyone to talk to anymore...

42:49.760 --> 42:52.630
Now, hand the sample over to me.

43:20.960 --> 43:22.120
Fine then.

43:40.750 --> 43:41.940
W-What?

43:54.830 --> 43:57.390
Without its master, Robo is nothing.

43:57.560 --> 43:59.290
Now is my chance to...

44:08.470 --> 44:10.170
It can't be! From inside?

44:17.980 --> 44:20.180
G-Ginrei?

44:25.560 --> 44:27.120
Pull back! Retreat!

44:37.770 --> 44:38.860
Ginrei!

44:42.810 --> 44:45.040
Thank you, Daisaku...

44:45.210 --> 44:46.640
I've made up my mind as well...

44:47.010 --> 44:48.010
What?

44:48.350 --> 44:52.250
Until now, I've been
afraid to use my power...

44:52.480 --> 44:55.650
but I now realize that
this is when I have to use it...

44:56.060 --> 44:57.220
B-But...

44:58.790 --> 45:00.850
I have to go and find out...

45:01.190 --> 45:06.220
Just like you believe in your
father, I want to believe in mine...

45:06.630 --> 45:08.460
I'm taking this sample and...

45:20.880 --> 45:28.290
<i>Episode 6: Crime and Punishment,
Everything for Big Fire, The End</i>

48:23.460 --> 48:26.090
Now, with a turbulent turn of
events, the tale nears its climax!

48:26.430 --> 48:28.870
A storm of uncertainty
surrounds the Magnificent Ten!

48:28.970 --> 48:32.100
Will Genya succeed in completing his plans?

48:34.810 --> 48:37.740
Will Chief Chujo's powers alone
be enough to put a stop to the...

48:37.910 --> 48:39.470
approaching Giant Sphere?

48:40.350 --> 48:43.680
The stage for the final conflict
has been set at St. Abbe...

48:43.820 --> 48:45.480
the place once known as Bashtarle.

48:45.580 --> 48:49.390
Ginrei decides to risk everything
to save the future of earth!

48:49.890 --> 48:53.090
And finally, all the
mysteries will be revealed!

48:53.290 --> 48:57.630
While one man observes all of
this with an evil smile on his face...

48:58.630 --> 49:00.860
Good! This is good!

49:01.030 --> 49:03.940
All the players have now gathered!

49:04.170 --> 49:10.080
Yes, everything is
proceeding as I had planned!

49:12.540 --> 49:19.970
<i>The final episode...</i>

49:20.090 --> 49:26.030
<i>Last episode: Grand Finale,
Fading is the Beautiful Illusory Night</i>
